WEBVTT

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:34.470
Where can he be...?

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.590
What...

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:46.780
do you need...?

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:51.760
Lo...

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.090
Lord Dio!

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:09.080
Hol Horse...

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:12.840
I'm asking you, what you need?

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:14.150
To...

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:15.840
To report...

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.150
Report...?

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.230
Th..that...

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:23.630
Po..Polnareff...that guy has defected to...

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.360
Jo...

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.920
Joestar's group...

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.090
Hol Horse...

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.690
What Polnareff did...

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.360
is unimportant.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.760
Anyone can be a messenger...

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.930
wouldn't you say, Hol Horse?

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:40.470
Don't waste your time hanging around here.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:41.880
Hurry up...

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:45.110
and prove your loyalty to me.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.090
Do hurry with Joestars' termination...

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:55.590
and live up to my expectations.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.720
<i> You gotta be shittin' me... </i>

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.960
<i> How dare you tell me to live </i>
<i> up to your expectations? </i>

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.500
<i> Who do you think you are...? </i>

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.540
<i> Besides, you're giving me </i>
<i> plenty of chances to attack. </i>

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:09.000
<i> Heh! Isn't everyone giving </i>
<i> you a little too much credit? </i>

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:12.100
<i> I didn't pledge you loyalty </i>
<i> from the heart or anything. </i>

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.080
<i> Adios, Dio! </i>

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.420
<i> Regret this moment in hell! </i>

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.590
W...what!?

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.730
Even at the moment when
you make your move to kill...

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.360
you don't sweat, and your
breathing remains stable.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:42.440
Not bad, Hol Horse.

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.610
There's no way...how...?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.950
How did he get behind me...?

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.610
I...

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:01.750
I don't get it...

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:06.830
I don't...

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:09.260
I just don't get it!

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.980
Why am I having a dream like this now?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.420
I see...

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.730
I understand.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.330
Currently, we're somewhere around here...

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:50.430
so if we continue at this rate, we should
come across the Red Sea within a few days.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.200
And...

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.440
once we pass through here...

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.180
Egypt.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:02.910
We're getting close.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.690
Ah, sorry, sorry...

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:09.660
Well...

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.290
shall we go...?

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:14.520
Mr. Joestar, who were you calling?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.230
Oh...

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.670
My friend in Egypt.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.770
Anyway, it's already been more
than thirty days since we left Japan.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:25.540
There's no time to waste, let's move on.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.670
Yes, that's right.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:46.260
You're more beautiful than ever.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:48.930
Hol Horse...

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.430
But really, I never imagined you...

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:02.240
...would come down here in person.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.710
Hey, hey, don't give me that look.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.810
If you and I join forces, we'll
make an invincible pair.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.780
Well, let's help each other...

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.320
You're so cold.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.420
Wha...!?

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.460
What do you think you're doing!?

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:25.230
Why do you suppose you
were asked to come here?

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:29.530
A chance to avenge the death of J. Gail...

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.230
Lord Dio granted me that.

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:33.710
Av-v-v-v-v...

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.750
Av...avenge?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:41.250
How dare you abandon J.Gail and
shamelessly make your way back here.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:42.180
Wa...

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.510
Wait!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.610
You have it all wrong!

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:48.320
By the time I arrived, J.
Gail was already dead!

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:49.990
Stop making excuses!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.650
You shall atone for the crime
of abandoning J. Gail...

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.230
...by your death!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.470
You too, must have heard
rumors but have never seen it...

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.230
my Stand.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.700
N...no way...

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:05.870
That's...!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:06.670
Yes...

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.900
I'll show it you, Hol Horse.

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:13.170
My Stand...

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.210
Justice!

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:23.990
Wha...

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:24.860
A mi...

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:25.450
mist?

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.190
Yes...a mist of death.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.490
Death...?

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:31.200
Wha...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.130
What's this!?

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.200
What's going on!?

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.440
A clean hole has opened.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:46.950
Yes...my Stand, Justice, is a Stand of mist.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:53.450
Whatever wound this mist touches
will end up with a hole like that.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.750
Go dance with Justice!

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:00.790
Y-You gotta be shittin' me...!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.570
Enough is...enough!

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:13.930
The mist enters the hole...

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.010
and turns you into a puppet.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.210
What the...!?

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.440
Shit...!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:29.060
Die by your own Stand, Hol Horse!

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:37.900
Justice prevails.

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.580
Polnareff...

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:54.510
are you doing alright with your driving?

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.850
The fog is getting quite dense...

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.890
Yeah, this is not too good.

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:04.460
To think...it's only three o'clock.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.820
We have no choice...

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.490
Let's find a town nearby where
we can stay for the night.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.590
Alright.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.230
What is it with this town...?

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:45.730
It's too quiet...

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:48.270
For some reason, it gives me the creeps.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.510
Hey! Jotaro!

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.100
Ah...that's true.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.370
No point in just standing around here.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.540
In any case, let's look for a hotel.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:05.950
Hey, hey...isn't there anyone in this town?

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:09.020
Geez, I can't even ask for directions.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.960
Somebody dumped a dead dog.

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:16.530
Ehhh...that's disgusting.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.030
It stinks, too.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:19.690
Oh, there's someone!

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:20.800
Hey, mister!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.870
Excuse us, but we're looking for a hotel.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:26.700
Can we find a hotel with clean
bathrooms around here?

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:28.740
Really, sorry to bother you
while you're napping...

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.440
but could you wake up for a second?

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.910
Is...is he dead?

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:35.780
Why, out on the street like this...?

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:38.550
Could it be a heart attack...or something?

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:39.710
It's possible.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.550
But, it doesn't seem like
a simple heart attack.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:45.720
His hand...why don't
you pull it out of there...

00:12:45.960 --> 00:12:46.690
O...

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:47.560
Okay.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:50.600
Whoa!

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.340
The gun is still warm.

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.440
It hasn't been long since it was fired.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.350
He killed himself with the pistol, then?

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:08.850
The wound...

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:09.680
This must be it!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.350
Right under his throat is
a hole the size of a coin!

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:14.350
Is that the cause of death?

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.230
But, why isn't it bleeding?

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.290
A large, deep hole like that
should bleed like crazy.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.370
Normally, that is...

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:24.230
B...

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.030
But...

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:25.830
Th...

00:13:25.940 --> 00:13:27.130
There's more....

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:32.600
W-what happened to this dead body!?

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:35.110
There are holes all over the place.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.080
And not a trace of blood
from any of the holes!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.120
Why was he killed this way!?

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.780
Is there some meaning to it!?

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:42.720
Shit!

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.080
I have no idea what the hell this is all about!

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.820
Calm down, Polnareff.

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:50.190
In...

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:51.390
In any case...

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:52.860
The police...

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:54.490
W...!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:55.090
Wait!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.260
You, there!

00:13:56.370 --> 00:14:00.230
I'm sorry, but a man died over there,
so could you call the police and...

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:01.700
I'm asking you to wait!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:02.900
Can't you hear me!?

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.300
Are you talking to me...?

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.130
What is it?

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:09.440
Y-yes...

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.750
A man died over there...

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.650
so I'd like to ask you to get the police.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.180
Ah...

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.680
A man...

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.220
I see...

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:23.820
So you want me to report it to the police...

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.660
Ahhh...so itchy...

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.560
Y...yes!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:30.390
Please hurry.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.100
What's going on?

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:36.570
What's up with the people in this town?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:37.900
Old man...

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.370
What do you think?

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.240
I'm wondering if this could be
a work of another Stand user.

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:50.920
But why would our pursuer murder an
innocent man prior to our arrival here?

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.390
I don't see the motive.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.490
There's still a chance.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.660
His death is too unusual.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.290
Joestar-san...

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.660
just as Jotaro said...

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.390
if, in this town somewhere...

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:05.660
a Stand user is hiding...

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.400
we should escape as soon as possible.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.900
Escape in this fog?

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.000
Now, that's what I call suicidal!

00:15:13.110 --> 00:15:14.670
Then, what are we supposed to do!?

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.670
How should I know!?

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.670
Both of you, calm down!

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.580
Why argue about it!?

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:44.440
It must be here...

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.370
a dead person.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:50.480
I have brought you the police.

00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.880
Ah! Finally a decent person shows up!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.120
So it seems.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:02.320
From what I see, I
presume you are travelers.

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:06.620
But with this fog, I'm afraid it's too
dangerous to drive out of town...

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:09.760
I happen to manage a hotel.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:13.130
How about staying over tonight?

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:16.130
Yahoo! You're a godsend!

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:19.170
We were actually looking for
one. Old lady, you saved us!

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:21.640
C'mon, everyone, let's stay there...Let’s!

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:23.900
Alright.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:26.910
How about you two?

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:42.060
My, those officers are rough.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.390
Really...

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.400
How can they act so indifferent about
seeing such a strange dead body?

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:47.760
Geez!

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.900
Well, well...my dear guests.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.010
Shall we get going too?

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.310
The fog is very dense...

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.410
please follow me, so you don't get lost.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:00.780
Hey, old lady, wait up!

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.150
Please don't forget your luggage.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:06.310
We're leaving now, are you ready...?

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:09.550
Anytime. We're just staying for one night...

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.130
so we don't have much luggage!

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.660
C'mon, c'mon everyone!

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.600
Well, well...we have arrived.

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.940
This is my hotel.

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.280
Here, here...welcoming the party of four.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:32.680
Come in, come in.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.990
To think this place is managed by an
old hag like her. I was worried, but...

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:43.790
this turned out to be a real find!

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:45.660
So it would seem.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:50.430
Please sign right here, Mr. Joestar...

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:51.730
Old woman...

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.430
you just called him by the name "Joestar."

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.930
How do you know that name?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:04.910
Oh please, my dear guest.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:10.920
He was addressed earlier as Mr.
Joestar by the gentleman over there...

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:13.210
Me?

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.120
Uh, lemme see...

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:18.460
did I or did I not say that...?

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:21.060
But, no, wait, at the time...

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.100
Let's see...

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.860
Hey! You're the one who called him that!

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:31.070
Just because I'm old, it doesn't mean you
can treat me like I'm going senile! Dang it!

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:34.800
Uh...uh-huh, I said it! I said it! Yeah,
I certainly did say that, Jotaro!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.340
Now I remember...yes, indeed...yes, indeed!

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:44.650
Didn't I tell you!? It's because
you didn't make yourself clear!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.590
My fault, my fault, old lady, really!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.130
N-Yah...

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:52.850
A woman...

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:56.430
She's been staying with us since yesterday.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.860
What about her?

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:04.870
No, I just thought it was unusual for
a woman to be traveling by herself.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.200
A beautiful lady...

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.250
quite rare around here.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.450
That beautiful?

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.710
I'd definitely love to get acquainted.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:16.880
Impossible.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:29.600
I regret to mention that only Mr. Polnareff's
room will be on the second floor...

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.360
What? That's no problem at all.

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.060
By the way, may I ask you a question?

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:39.300
Since we've met you, you've been
using your right hand only, and um...

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.140
your left hand...

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.140
is there something wrong with it?

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:46.040
Oh, my left hand...

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:48.520
I burned this hand.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:52.150
I accidentally spilled hot water on it.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:55.290
I see...

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:57.160
you should be more careful.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.960
Yes, thank you...

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:03.400
from now on, I will be more careful...

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:09.400
What was that about earlier, Jotaro...?

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:12.440
You never know where the enemy might be,

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.640
so I thought I'd ask a trick question.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.110
And...

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.550
Ever since we arrived in this town...

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.880
I've had this feeling that
we're being watched.

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:24.350
I agree.

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:25.890
A woman from Egypt...

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.290
a peculiar dead body...

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.450
too much to be coincidental.

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:33.090
Oops, Room 303, this is mine.

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.130
Well, we'll talk tomorrow.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:47.770
I'm beat!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.900
The bed sure is better than the truck!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.400
Damn it...!

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:17.430
For some reason...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.910
that left hand is keeping me awake.

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:24.080
Maybe I should have a drink.

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.820
It's this way.

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:50.870
Whoa, I'm in luck! She's the woman
that old lady was talking about.

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:09.890
Give me a whiskey on the rocks!

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:11.460
I'm Polnareff.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.530
Are you by yourself? What's
your name? Sightseeing?

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:16.330
Let me buy you a drink.
What would you like?

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:17.370
Are you single?

00:22:17.470 --> 00:22:19.900
Well, I couldn't get to sleep...!

00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:22.270
Oh, today is such a lucky day!

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:23.260
My name is...

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.500
N-Yah...

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:40.050
Just like...

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:42.180
a town of the dead.

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:49.700
Who's there!?

00:22:53.070 --> 00:22:54.260
<i> My imagination...? </i>

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:57.670
<i> It felt like someone was watching me... </i>

00:23:15.830 --> 00:23:17.190
I...

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:20.160
am traveling in search of a person.

00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:21.490
A person...?

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:24.200
If you don't mind, tell me about it.

00:23:26.140 --> 00:23:31.210
A killer...

00:23:34.710 --> 00:23:35.970
What a coincidence!

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:37.710
We're sharing the same experience!

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:39.210
That is so unreal...

00:23:42.450 --> 00:23:46.250
My own precious flesh and blood...

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:48.720
was brutally murdered.

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:56.530
I understand...

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:58.330
I understand how you feel..

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:00.130
I too...

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:03.140
My sister was murdered.

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:07.240
I'll help you, N-Yah.

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:12.400
Huh...? W-what the...!?

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:14.480
Y...

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:15.280
You!

00:24:15.520 --> 00:24:16.880
Hol Horse!

00:24:16.990 --> 00:24:18.420
How can you be here...?

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:22.890
Rrr...uuu...nnn!

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:24.320
W-what...!?

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:31.730
How persistent...

00:24:32.640 --> 00:24:34.400
I have nothing against you, but...

00:24:44.510 --> 00:24:46.680
What's up with this guy?

00:24:46.780 --> 00:24:49.510
He seems to be no ordinary human...

00:24:49.620 --> 00:24:51.110
but why is he after me?

00:24:55.790 --> 00:24:57.760
What is it, Ms. N-Yah?

00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:01.190
I didn't finish my story yet, did I?

00:25:01.300 --> 00:25:04.790
Actually, I've already found the killer.

00:25:14.540 --> 00:25:16.270
Y-you were dead!

00:25:16.550 --> 00:25:18.710
Weren't you that guy lying
dead on the street earlier!?

00:25:18.820 --> 00:25:20.250
How can you be moving around!?

00:25:20.350 --> 00:25:22.440
It's you, Polnareff...

00:25:23.890 --> 00:25:26.080
A nuisance to Lord Dio...

00:25:26.190 --> 00:25:29.650
and my son, J. Gail's, killer.

00:25:30.660 --> 00:25:31.890
Son...?

00:25:32.730 --> 00:25:34.750
You're his mother?

00:25:34.860 --> 00:25:35.730
Then...

00:25:35.830 --> 00:25:37.600
you're a Stand user too!

00:25:43.770 --> 00:25:46.770
There is only one Stand per person.

00:25:46.880 --> 00:25:48.240
But you see...

00:25:48.340 --> 00:25:50.840
my Stand, Justice...

00:25:50.950 --> 00:25:53.880
my Stand of the mist controls the dead.

00:25:53.980 --> 00:25:55.490
Hundreds...

00:25:55.490 --> 00:25:58.610
and thousands, without any limitations!

00:26:00.360 --> 00:26:05.230
Since they're already
dead, you can't kill them.

00:26:05.330 --> 00:26:06.590
There you go...

00:26:06.700 --> 00:26:10.330
my beloved dead!

00:26:19.340 --> 00:26:20.970
Now I get it.

00:26:21.310 --> 00:26:24.800
How dare you kill my son.

00:26:25.720 --> 00:26:29.080
Die a slow, painful death...

00:26:29.190 --> 00:26:30.520
Polnareff.
